- **`/workspace/repo/code/core/src/core-server/utils/ghost-stories/parse-vitest-report.ts`** imports `categorizeError` and `ErrorCategory` and aggregates results into a `Map<ErrorCategory, { count, uniqueErrors: Set<string>, matchedDependencies: Set<string> }>`, then emits `matchedDependencies: Array.from(data.matchedDependencies).sort()`.
